@{ Layout = "_LayoutPublic"; ViewData["Title"] = "Smart Port AI Operations Platform"; }
<section class="spx-hero spx-hero--cinematic">
  <div class="container spx-hero__grid">
    <div><span class="spx-kicker">Prototype · pilot-ready architecture · synthetic demo data</span><h1>Agentic AI for port logistics, queue execution, fleet coordination, and emissions-aware operations.</h1><p class="spx-lead">Smart Port connects the control room, fleet owners, and drivers through AI-assisted execution plans, app-based check-ins, fleet tracking, audit trails, and Gemini-powered operational reasoning.</p><div class="spx-actions"><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary sp-btn--lg" href="/demo-access">Demo Access</a><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline sp-btn--lg" href="/demo-tour">Start Judge Tour</a><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline sp-btn--lg" href="/enterprise-readiness">View Enterprise Readiness</a><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline sp-btn--lg" href="/fleet/download-app">Driver App</a></div><p class="spx-note">Synthetic operational scenario for judging. Pilot connectors can ingest IPMS/TOS, berth schedules, gate systems, fleet GPS, Driver Companion App data, optional WhatsApp Cloud API, ERP, weather/disruption feeds, and emissions data. No live customer integration is claimed.</p></div>
    <img src="/images/smart-port-hero.svg" alt="Smart Port AI control room original illustration" />
  </div>
</section>
<section class="container spx-section"><span class="spx-kicker">From signal to execution</span><h2>Complete operational loop</h2><div class="spx-module-grid">@foreach (var item in new[] { "Public story", "Identity demo login", "Port Admin command centre", "Gemini Operations Agent", "Execution plan", "Fleet owner action", "Driver Companion App tracking", "Mobile API status", "Driver confirmation", "Updated queue state", "Audit trail", "Emissions report" }) { <article class="spx-module-card"><strong>@item</strong><p>Connected in the demo as a human-approved workflow step.</p></article> }</div></section>
<section class="container spx-section spx-visual-grid"><img src="/images/control-room-panel.svg" alt="AI control room visual"/><div><span class="spx-kicker">Operational AI module</span><h2>Not just a chatbot</h2><p>The Gemini Operations Agent combines structured truck queue, gate pressure, berth readiness, driver confirmation, app check-in state and idling estimates, then compares deterministic fallback with Gemini-enhanced explanation.</p><div class="spx-actions"><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary" href="/gemini-agent">Open AI Agent</a><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="/driver-app">Open Driver App</a></div></div></section>
<section class="container spx-section"><div class="spx-module-grid spx-module-grid--features">
<article class="spx-module-card"><img src="/images/fleet-driver-loop.svg" alt="Fleet driver loop"/><h3>Fleet Owner</h3><p>Request app check-in, track drivers, move to staging, release to gate, reschedule, mark exception, or ask Gemini.</p></article>
<article class="spx-module-card"><img src="/images/mobile-driver-companion.svg" alt="Android companion"/><h3>Driver Companion</h3><p>Installable Android Driver Companion + web companion for truck status, instructions, location check-ins, driver actions and Copilot support. Mobile API is primary; WhatsApp is optional connector-ready only.</p></article>
<article class="spx-module-card"><img src="/images/gemini-agent-flow.svg" alt="Gemini agent flow"/><h3>Audit & Governance</h3><p>Every recommendation is framed as human-approved, reversible and visible in demo history.</p></article>
</div></section>
<section class="container spx-section spx-pilot"><span class="spx-kicker">Honest pilot integration path</span><h2>Connector-ready, not pretending to be live</h2><p>Smart Port is designed to connect to approved port, fleet, GPS/telematics, optional WhatsApp and energy data sources in a pilot. This submission uses synthetic demo data, explicit disclaimers and safe fallback behavior.</p><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="/enterprise-readiness">Enterprise readiness checklist</a></section>
